NotchLite is a modified distribution of Ada, based on upstream revision
5a1e17f040672a71685872b1b234e01d02a47bb5. Modified 2026-11-23.
Changes: separate application identity/storage, opt-in first-run settings,
mascot timer lifecycle, animation interval, measurement tooling and project docs.
Original attribution and third-party notices are retained below.
Further NotchLite changes: reentrant window shutdown, isolated startup setting,
UTF-16 input, editor focus lifecycle, web-link validation and weather cancellation.

